> **INVENTORY AUTHORITY CEILING:** The tables in this section preserve an
> older working snapshot for failure-pattern provenance. They do **not**
> establish current ownership, availability, stock form, dilution, carrier,
> concentration basis, quantity, or executable dose. Resolve current stock
> only through the pinned inventory runtime
> (`engine.inventory_parser.materialize_current_inventory()`) and its validated
> overlay/receipt; never promote a prose or retrieval match into inventory
> authority.

The historical rows remain unchanged below so earlier analyses can still be
interpreted. Their material-specific caution concepts may be useful as
reference hypotheses, but every stock-dependent statement requires current
authority and every safety or sensory claim requires its own applicable
evidence.

