| **Benzoin Siam (50%)** | 0.01% | 1500 | Heavy resin | ≤1% final; kills freshness; use only in amber/oriental |
| **Labdanum (10%)** | 0.02% | 2000 | Heavy, sticky | ≤0.5% final; buries other notes |

### 5.5.2 HISTORICAL MODERATE-RISK TABLE (Require Current Verification)

| Material | ODT | Typical Use Range | Key Failure Mode | Prevention Rule |
|----------|-----|-------------------|------------------|-----------------|
| **Iso E Super** | 0.2% | 5-15% | "Invisible" overdose | >18% causes olfactory fatigue; 8-15% optimal |
| **Ambroxan/Ambrox Super (10%)** | 0.05% | 2-8% | Salty skin smell | ≤8%; higher = "sweaty"; 3-5% optimal |
| **Hedione** | 0.3% | 3-8% | Waste if base is already radiant | Check: Is base flat? If not, max 2% |
| **Cashmeran (10%)** | 0.05% | 1-5% | Laundry musk | >3% final = "detergent"; use sparingly |
| **Galaxolide (80%)** | 0.1% | 2-8% | Laundry, IFRA concern | ≤4% final; clean musk but IFRA limited |
| **Beta Damascone (10%)** | 0.003% | 0.5-2% | Rose overdose | >0.3% final overpowers; trace use |
| **Patchouli EO** | 0.01% | 2-8% | Earthy dominance | >5% destroys clean/fresh; dark bases only |
| **Vetiver Extract** | 0.01% | 1-5% | Muddy/rooty | >3% = too earthy; green vetiver is cleaner |
| **Alpha/Beta Ionone (10%)** | 0.003% | 0.3-2% | Powdery overload | >0.5% final = old-fashioned powder |
| **Alpha-Irone (3%/Neat)** | 0.0005% | 0.5-3% | Expensive waste | Use owned Irotyl/Orris FTEC first unless irone-specific effect needed |
| **Coumarin (10%)** | 0.001% | 1-5% | IFRA restricted | IFRA Cat 4: 0.6% final max; track carefully |

